{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "d5be9919811a85b482ad90d164e32e728ef2fbcac705437e60072927265b21d7", "ja": "たたかえ！　いい子たち", "zh": "战斗吧！乖孩子们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9c8441ccbd483d49106005a32eb7b26a489937f6a778a111492765f4fe9352ea", "ja": "BOTの新しい勝負内容は、ポイント方式の\n『いい子対決』に決定。育、桃子、環だけで\nなく、やよい、伊織、響までもが参加する事\nに。いい子とは言うが、紛れもなくアイドル\n同士の対決だとわかり、気合いの入る一同。", "zh": "BOT的新对决内容决定为计分制的\n“乖孩子对决”。不仅是育、桃子和环，\n就连弥生、伊织和响也一同参加了。\n虽然说是乖孩子对决，但大家明白这毫无疑问\n也是偶像之间的对决，全都干劲十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b63332ded023cc26056dad794128a95801380e5290ce8c38a0f876b704732daa", "ja": "（今回行うBOTの企画内容が決まった！\nまずは、ルール解説の動画から撮らないと）", "zh": "（这次BOT比赛的企划内容定下来了！首先得拍摄讲解规则的视频。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "59b90048c6ad7b57707673ded4cf4a4dc1288f845f344f6190c26dc1d305ca8c", "ja": "えっと……みなさん、こんにちは。\n中谷育です。", "zh": "那个……大家好。\n我是中谷育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "f68763473071a8bd0d77e688dfddfe44c66663fd29d371902ec9dc7e2275c56b", "ja": "お、おはようございます！\nあ！　夜見てる人もいるかも……？", "zh": "早、早上好！\n啊！也许也有人是在晚上看的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "54e7ede484b673501b5c30e6a0cc2de6fa4218484dc5b2469896b7f2bc48cbf5", "ja": "だったら……\nおは、こん、ばん、さま？です！", "zh": "那就……早、午、晚、安？是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "f88097494f934b42b0ccc40074a9fe3fdfec114d32ca7ac34f497f2f50a4364d", "ja": "環……。\nなに？　その聞いたことのない挨拶。", "zh": "环……。\n什么呀？这是什么没听过的问候语。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "fa07625d7020935c2030d1ec7ac3450f1f83a21dc2c8db8f351f1c61ef447e19", "ja": "もっと普通でいいんじゃない？　お兄ちゃんが\n撮ってるこの動画だって、後で編集するんだし。", "zh": "再普通一点不就好了？反正大哥哥\n拍的这段视频，之后也会剪辑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "842550b9d23bf964908aea9bd0689fed92dd77a7b1fa96e92eb0adf334361ea6", "ja": "ああ、桃子の言う通りだ。というか、\nみんな、意外と緊張してるんだな……。", "zh": "啊，桃子说得对。话说回来，大家好像都意外地紧张啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "9e35e89547e3c22d3bf2173ca4d47629af9437491ca37b5cde45c8ae9d12a39a", "ja": "そうなの。今回は『いい子対決』って聞いたから、\nちゃんとしなくちゃって思ったら……。", "zh": "就是嘛。我听说这次是“乖孩子对决”，想着一定要好好表现才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "09a0a46625296be5c2014686bcd185c9007c63d00c88173d3778a0ce655f6acb", "ja": "たまきも！　だから、あいさつは\nちゃんとしなきゃって……うう～。", "zh": "环也！所以我想着打招呼也得好好打……呜呜～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "681563d719b32bba3196a4c6a348ac6a816702b6ce3cdda7f8fa7f1dd48bee9f", "ja": "そんなに気を張らなくても大丈夫。\n普通に、いつも通りでいいんだ。", "zh": "不用那么紧张也没关系。\n像平常一样就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6036f736031a4e801245619a08e66630f41dc7cbea1267b5d87f8401e6646bfb", "ja": "って、口で言っても難しいか。\nみんな、ちょっとお手本を見せてくれないか？", "zh": "不过，光是嘴上说说也很难做到吧。\n大家能不能稍微示范一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "5378cf9b8ea6315be22efbed030ec309830c0479115d34bd832402e08f763539", "ja": "ふふん、任せるさー！\n3人とも、見ててね！", "zh": "哼哼，交给我吧——！\n你们这3人也要看好了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "a14619402ed7828a1643c712999a69f0ff62e0812796e5fae474d09bf77fddd1", "ja": "今度のBOTは『いい子対決』をするんだ！\n対戦相手はこの6人！", "zh": "这次的BOT要进行“乖孩子对决”！  \n对手就是这6人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "59dc330cd912765fda5f8c22e183675ba3c98a1cb2f31e391754de2e737744a9", "ja": "私たちがいい子な行動をすると、\n『いい子ポイント』がもらえるんです！", "zh": "我们做出乖孩子的行为，\n就能获得\"乖孩子积分\"哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "c14fc3fbf8730966e5c3416c0a30f82b5c42d21c3f4debdfb3ff65626ca9a546", "ja": "期間中にこの6人で競って、最終日に\n一番ポイントが多かった人が優勝ですー！", "zh": "在活动期间，我们这6个人要一决高下，最后一天积分最多的人就是冠军啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "10547939f099bb1478b1243a10ab3885779ef4edecabe0affcac5b042bc6f760", "ja": "その様子は、動画で撮影してもらうことになってるわ。\nファンのみんなにも、投票してもらうから……。", "zh": "到时候会请人把整个过程拍成视频。\n也会让粉丝们投票……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "a0c825bb19bee7249c99e97f3f3bce1d4226a9815137de1c82035368c3cf1de9", "ja": "みんなは、ウルトラキュートな伊織ちゃんの\nとってもいい子なところ、ちゃんと見ててね……？", "zh": "大家可要好好看着，超级可爱的伊织\n是多么乖巧的孩子哦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "1e13de523301596c3e05f748c3f086e096f105e4c72246a2913ae53f1a9e8f8e", "ja": "おお～……。\nすっごくわかりやすいぞ～！", "zh": "哦哦～……\n真是特别容易看懂啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "cd6aa83d07181b58f39cd521ee44db91e2fabaa0c1ff8581d9d41f5cbe80f539", "ja": "うん！　わたしたち、\nちょっときんちょうしすぎてたかも。", "zh": "嗯！我们刚才可能有点太紧张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "9b200c9cb3cd92c46fc5a303a00b2bd097e7bd426fbfa102f8bded958407834c", "ja": "さすが、経験値が違うね。\n……ああいう伊織さん、久々に見たけど……。", "zh": "不愧是你，经验值就是不一样。\n……好久没见到那样的伊织了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "9d6ec3a0db6c616485c34a4ca8bb7e5c4c477b629633b7df802000f852e855e6", "ja": "自分はみんなのお姉さんとして、\nいい子を判定してポイントをあげるんだ！", "zh": "我作为大家的大姐姐，\n要来评定谁是乖孩子，再给他们加分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "0f2789cf58f7d873047534a614e970f64544974bdca25b262ce5555c2ad1dc75", "ja": "あれっ？\nそうなんですか？　{$P$}。", "zh": "咦？是这样吗，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3355a4604a80db353b61ef01e2d9081d79aefb689413531f4e68d92b07269fd8", "ja": "いや、ポイント判定員と撮影は俺が兼任する。\n響は正式な参加者だぞ。", "zh": "不，积分判定员和拍摄由我兼任。\n响是正式的参赛者哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "4fc7b8727d60698d941e81eba76398402150922a7bbc9517050d5292f7dd252b", "ja": "ええっ！？　だ、だって、小学生や中学生に\nまざっていい子を目指すって……。", "zh": "诶诶！？可、可是，要和小学生、初中生混在一起，努力成为乖孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "e06e3d5cbfd299aaceb9532ccc0ae8794fd17cea78f8ce777d1b9e1c360e3152", "ja": "自分、もう高校生だぞ！？\nさすがにこれは、抗議させてもらうからね！", "zh": "我已经是高中生了啊！？\n这未免也太过分了，我可要抗议了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "4af96a0fe9e69568d17c51ac0a6d0e117724e1ea3165d5e2899be81efd74bae4", "ja": "あら？　響が自信ないなんて、\n珍しいわね。", "zh": "咦？响居然会没有自信，真少见呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "1092ef5d0de5e7de7498b1bc603a983712327f82ffdf3232f349a8f0aa5d31c8", "ja": "い、いやそうじゃなくて！", "zh": "不、不是那样的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "73b2e7d65b965596422fa03e8b154844be1639062ad8646da99a5ecb6f00b4de", "ja": "勝負に小学生も高校生もないじゃない。\n今まで、相手の年齢で手抜きしたことあるの？", "zh": "比拼就是比拼，和小学生还是高中生没关系吧。\n你以前有因为对手的年龄而放水过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "cc327e8dfef67606f7fbb746e3f6ca61786adc43257d317509ed8d33367d5ae3", "ja": "そんなの、あるわけないさー！\n……あ、そっか。これはアイドルとしての勝負……。", "zh": "那种事，当然不可能啦——！\n……啊，原来如此。这是作为偶像的较量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "d844877d2efa9a953f65904e3646229ae80144088f46bdfe96fa2e90d5f501e0", "ja": "そういうことなら、遠慮しないさー！\n伊織もみんなも追い抜いて、自分が圧勝するからね！", "zh": "既然这样，我就不客气啦！  \n我会超过伊织和大家，取得压倒性的胜利！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1030_007ior", "source_sha256": "d6f31a16bfe4bdec0a2be2133f2e6e4cf013bde985ba5aa5bdbf2f7ded5d29ac", "ja": "いいわよ？　伊織ちゃん相手に\n圧勝できるなら、やってみなさい！", "zh": "好啊？要是真能赢过\n伊织我的话，你就试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "41f9a46f2755a81c170b497088ebf0d15ff463ef68c976aca53d455b9d8a2140", "ja": "さすがは伊織……。\n見事なコントロールだ……。", "zh": "不愧是伊织……  \n控球真漂亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "0d9ae5d8665173ea70ae4d8cbcbc1cad7ba6a26aaaf08e88855697c859ebb007", "ja": "本来あんたがやんのよ、こういうのは。", "zh": "这种事本来就该由你来做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "a8b631eca6d76eef065ac8b36a1678ddf2d2511b1ddb864812325f07ba26ab0c", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。\n撮影もあってつい……すまん、助かったよ。", "zh": "对、对啊……  \n还要拍摄，我一不小心就……抱歉，真是帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "5c34d3ca8215e4f521615b39d58ff786ff94d44a42c6d80a64ae62abf0cbc40c", "ja": "それじゃあ、最後の〆をもらえるかな。\n育、桃子、環！", "zh": "那么，最后就交给你们收尾了。\n育、桃子、环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
